{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27185","headline":"竹 · 崔涯","name":"竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"领得溪风不放回，傍窗缘砌遍庭栽。\n须招野客爲邻住，看引山禽入郭来。\n幽院独惊秋气早，小门深向绿阴开。\n谁怜翠色兼寒影，静落茶瓯与酒杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔涯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}